{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Vivat Slovakia</i> is an open-world game set in the newly independent Slovakia, a country on the dividing line between East and West. As remnants of communism linger, weakened institutions allow corruption to thrive, and power falls into the hands of the highest bidder. Fueled by money and violence, the \u201cwild '90s\u201d era brings a city steeped in intrigue and danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2132690/extras/884341e4e3bf4776c6f9d89b738c523b.avif?t=1763388731\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2132690/extras_big/884341e4e3bf4776c6f9d89b738c523b.avif?t=1763388731 width=800 height=122 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2132690/extras/586ba9126dd74f17a8f69668dd235af4.poster.avif?t=1763388731\" width=602 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2132690/extras/586ba9126dd74f17a8f69668dd235af4.webm?t=1763388731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2132690/extras/586ba9126dd74f17a8f69668dd235af4.mp4?t=1763388731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the gritty charm of '90s Bratislava as an undercover cop posing as a taxi driver. Roam 10 km\u00b2 of faithfully recreated streets, landmarks, and real-life locations in a city torn between communism and capitalism. Dive into a raw, dynamic open world and witness Slovakia\u2019s capital in all its untamed, Slavic glory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2132690/extras/0ee89fe494fe7e9b1094cb2c19c5f9b7.avif?t=1763388731\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2132690/extras_big/0ee89fe494fe7e9b1094cb2c19c5f9b7.avif?t=1763388731 width=800 height=122 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2132690/extras/640f8f85ee25238de23f84a3dfdc59e2.poster.avif?t=1763388731\" width=602 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2132690/extras/640f8f85ee25238de23f84a3dfdc59e2.webm?t=1763388731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2132690/extras/640f8f85ee25238de23f84a3dfdc59e2.mp4?t=1763388731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive over 50 vehicles\u2014from rugged socialist workhorses to rare luxury imports\u2014that capture the style and class divide of early '90s Slovakia. With realistic physics and authentic detail, every car brings you closer to the streets and stories of the era.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2132690/extras/856d9aaa7c7ec163974b56deb8621fd9.avif?t=1763388731\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2132690/extras_big/856d9aaa7c7ec163974b56deb8621fd9.avif?t=1763388731 width=800 height=122 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2132690/extras/b54687425f419f24872694f6db2b69c4.poster.avif?t=1763388731\" width=602 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2132690/extras/b54687425f419f24872694f6db2b69c4.webm?t=1763388731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2132690/extras/b54687425f419f24872694f6db2b69c4.mp4?t=1763388731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a story inspired by real events\u2014one of loyalty, corruption, and power plays in \u201890s Slovakia. Unravel shifting alliances where politics and crime collide, with missions rooted in historical conflict and brought to life by professional voice actors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2132690/extras/c76088c4e8c8b57d40092b9c1a9ab906.avif?t=1763388731\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2132690/extras_big/c76088c4e8c8b57d40092b9c1a9ab906.avif?t=1763388731 width=800 height=122 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2132690/extras/bd7c60f1cc525ace354829aee455943c.poster.avif?t=1763388731\" width=602 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2132690/extras/bd7c60f1cc525ace354829aee455943c.webm?t=1763388731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2132690/extras/bd7c60f1cc525ace354829aee455943c.mp4?t=1763388731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >'90s Bratislava is a warzone\u2014where gangs rule, cops look the other way, and violence erupts in broad daylight. Vivat Slovakia drops you into this chaos, armed with historically accurate weapons that defined survival in a world where \u201cyou don\u2019t have what you don\u2019t steal.   </p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Smashing Pumpkins","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2132690/e56f566ebd33009f97ff539ba2c1e3d572ed842a.jpg"},{"name":"Handle with Care","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2132690/60d5cbf0d66caf65b0be3e952527d24e1a760c44.jpg"},{"name":"We made this in Unity!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2132690/ebc8925ded17052b07b4f789519314a5e6b3802c.jpg"},{"name":"Bratislava's quite nice from down here!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2132690/fa5793492af81626c68620ea10d0390c631e970d.jpg"},{"name":"It's cheaper off the books, boss! ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2132690/487f327997bfee9f8397423ade08b9328ebee9ac.jpg"},{"name":"I'm more familiar with fish...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2132690/36f06812309e6848488c3459e9169630438a9ce3.jpg"},{"name":"A Normal Human Story","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2132690/4f7bbd608714351e46f0f21086865134859deab8.jpg"},{"name":"Grand Theft","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2132690/f60e9287f0469cff295f23b97f69d071b3c7f58a.jpg"},{"name":"Solid Bronze","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2132690/69af9d36482f44e17f4a628baffecd58572fd831.jpg"},{"name":"Quick Silver","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2132690/edec612dbd5c0223f3f7a8dbfbb9e7ae829a3d5a.jpg"}],"total":15},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2132690?t=1763388731","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/sto